atchHandler with the same names unquoted. With\nany data-dimension org unit group set (column named by its mixed-case\nUID) Postgres folds the name to lower case and the insert fails with\n`column \"\u003cuid lowercased\u003e\" ... does not exist`. The error was only\nlogged, so the analytics job reported success with an empty ownership\ntable, and OWNER_AT_START/OWNER_AT_END silently used the enrollment org\nunit instead.\n\nMappingBatchHandler now takes an optional column quoter, applied to the\ncolumn names in the generated SQL only, so row map keys stay unquoted.\nThe ownership table manager quotes with SqlUtils::quote, since the batch\nhandler writes through the main Postgres JDBC configuration.\n\nEventAnalyticsServiceTest now includes a data-dimension org unit group\nset with a mixed-case UID; without the fix its six ownership tests fail\nwith the production error.\n\n🤖 AI Assisted","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"a26670428b3445f5d567f3ed67217939a7a3360a","tree_id":"be281a2231934ce5e520c9cf001c2df9a9ecfea5","timestamp":"2026-10-18T05:40:27Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/10954","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users